  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Addressing Social Determinants of Health for Gender equality</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the Action is to support the Government of Ethiopia to improve health and well-being of its citizens.The intervention focuses on women and attempts to address health impacts of nutrition, family planning and WaSH from a gender perspective.</narrative>
  </description>
